From f7603a225bd34cdf0ab4a8a86faf62f62b17ae95 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Van Tran <tetcu@fgorg.vn>
Date: Tue, 10 Nov 2026 15:09:03 +0700
Subject: [PATCH] feat(workflow): agents cannot move an issue out of a step a
 person handles

A step whose handler resolves to a member is an owner gate. An agent actor
(task token) changing the status or the project of an issue in such a step
gets 403 {code: owner_gate}; the batch endpoint skips the issue. Members are
unaffected; agents still move issues into the gate.

Patch-Id: owner-gates
---
